        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees will be permitted to take two (2) weeks of their vacation on a one day-at-a-time basis with the following restrictions:",
            "block_bbox": [
                192,
                454,
                1074,
                513
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    192.0,
                    454.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    454.0
                ],
                [
                    1074.0,
                    513.0
                ],
                [
                    192.0,
                    513.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Employees must be eligible for two (2) weeks of vacation before vacation on a day-at-a-time basis may be taken.",
            "block_bbox": [
                191,
                536,
                1069,
                595
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    191.0,
                    536.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    536.0
                ],
                [
                    1069.0,
                    595.0
                ],
                [
                    191.0,
                    595.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Employees must elect to take one week of vacation on a one day-at-a-time basis at the time the vacation schedules are chosen. The second week of day-at-a-time vacation may be taken on a half (1/2) day or one (1) day-at-a-time basis at the time the vacation schedules are chosen.",
            "block_bbox": [
                189,
                620,
                1046,
                736
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    189.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    1046.0,
                    620.0
                ],
                [
                    1046.0,
                    736.0
                ],
                [
                    189.0,
                    736.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Employees must notify and receive approval by their supervisor at least ten (10) working days prior to changing a day of vacation. The supervisor may waive this requirement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                188,
                759,
                1051,
                844
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    188.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    1051.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    1051.0,
                    844.0
                ],
                [
                    188.0,
                    844.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. A day of vacation shall not be scheduled in conjunction with a holiday. Also, the last workday preceding or the first day following a holiday will not be scheduled as a vacation day. The supervisor may waive this requirement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                185,
                869,
                1038,
                983
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    185.0,
                    869.0
                ],
                [
                    1038.0,
                    869.0
                ],
                [
                    1038.0,
                    983.0
                ],
                [
                    185.0,
                    983.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. In selection of day-at-a-time vacation, weeks vacation shall have precedence over day-at-a-time vacation selection.",
            "block_bbox": [
                187,
                1007,
                979,
                1067
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
